            "review_title": "Review at Tiệm Cơm Bà Tôi",
            "review_text": "Trail10162681209\n3 contributions\n1\nThe meal ruined the trip to Nha Trang :)))\nAug 2023 • Friends\nOrder a tray of rice for 199k (including crab soup with mixed vegetables, braised shrimp, braised meat with pepper, braised vegetables).\nWaited 40 minutes to get the food, then came out and handed out a plain tray of rice like in the picture (seems like I've already eaten a little bit). You can see the quality by looking at the pictures :)), the black liquid with scorched and bitter crumbs is the braised water :))), the meat flashes a few pieces stir-fried with lightly charred onions and lemongrass, that's the meat rim it with pepper ;))\nThe quality of the food is not half as good as the 35k popular rice on the street.\n\nFirst come, not first served, wait 40 minutes, well, almost an hour until I get a tiny plate of braised shrimp to put in my mouth. After a while, there are only a few remaining dishes, the food comes out like a pee. :))) Asked the waiter why the food took so long to come out. There weren't too many customers. The girl wearing glasses stood to pay and hang everything instead of comforting the waiting customers. :))) The food is so sketchy that it looks burnt, but the attitude is rude. Giving 1 star feels a bit lenient, but there are no negative stars :))\n\nAnyone who comes to Nha Trang should avoid going out and making themselves angry.\n\nOh, I forgot, I asked for free dessert for the rice, but I didn't see anything mentioned. We were so angry that we forgot about it after eating :))\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten August 12, 2023",
